      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这篇短短的报道或许显得有些杂乱无章。",
      "output_sha256": "7780bc533f5f5630f64598da4e417890ea9a6fc29a957863aabad829722d30b2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.473175,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bb62fe6176d24e7e8207ef6e362e02a289a065d4216d4fee84ac9448e4db3dcf"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7780bc533f5f5630f64598da4e417890ea9a6fc29a957863aabad829722d30b2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "希望我的文字能够热烈奔放，以弥补我对第一、第二点的遗忘！",
      "output_sha256": "2b6aef433d1061019b23efbf503d3b5bf645637db8602542465b984a1f0f5244",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.53395,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bc95a61e2e2fc87659fa91d1af38d6eab6647237f8f26dea1b8a537ac7e8bbb9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2b6aef433d1061019b23efbf503d3b5bf645637db8602542465b984a1f0f5244",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我并不提倡“乱七八糟主义”啊，假若有这么一个主义的话。",
      "output_sha256": "717d4391a50b90c3e9b17eb66ebd56026cfef0ba0c6884bc2ac95f865ed0f1be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "717d4391a50b90c3e9b17eb66ebd56026cfef0ba0c6884bc2ac95f865ed0f1be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "苏联第三次作家代表大会于5月18日在莫斯科举行。",
      "output_sha256": "0d82623cde2e72630ea2d84131d186fe048e626e3b0442375bdb1277c90c52e5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.91087,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "62e5f0174ad168cd8cfb598ef00fc0218662db0b4e4f32f08b8fdba0c012b918"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0d82623cde2e72630ea2d84131d186fe048e626e3b0442375bdb1277c90c52e5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "茅盾、黑丁和我代表中国作家协会前去祝贺。",
      "output_sha256": "5e582231d84444a753a1c2a5bfb0d0f5d7e9e4728c6300dd95bd8db2053a13b5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.827987,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b8354ab626f03cc961d642e7465ef44bbb0a18d0186714aef6a9e1f77ba32895"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5e582231d84444a753a1c2a5bfb0d0f5d7e9e4728c6300dd95bd8db2053a13b5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在会上，我见到了许多老朋友，也认识了不少新朋友，大家握手、拥抱、问候，相互微笑……谁还在意我说的第一点是我们热烈拥抱，第二点是问您太太好吗？",
      "output_sha256": "9569f778fe1b07e9569e236b8e9637b64d7171d10bba6712c0f7b9dbbfcd6eca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.649167,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e4f8ff36b8c04c73f9a5c62e572c1e903d04e29264e0e49f3ffc0281e29e44ad"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9569f778fe1b07e9569e236b8e9637b64d7171d10bba6712c0f7b9dbbfcd6eca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "看，那不是老邻居罗果夫同志么？",
      "output_sha256": "8bbd957a85590f959b60a449b5778820d46accdbdc604616512f249be0a1d3b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "8bbd957a85590f959b60a449b5778820d46accdbdc604616512f249be0a1d3b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "（他在北京时与我为邻。）",
      "output_sha256": "e4de01760b00e3e982f5a8d5f953993daa59dec0b6267c3296621ddcfbe598b6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "e4de01760b00e3e982f5a8d5f953993daa59dec0b6267c3296621ddcfbe598b6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们热情相拥后，他便邀请我参观“苏中友好”杂志的编辑部。",
      "output_sha256": "c7a2de28d945478d50c74c19079c9ec20979f3bbe9699888e3a0b710b96fa108",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.571973,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ccd5a5669ff00588a522894b4d6ca129f301683499c3cf5255992709c4e7898f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c7a2de28d945478d50c74c19079c9ec20979f3bbe9699888e3a0b710b96fa108",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "喝过一杯茶，他问我：这次到莫斯科来，印象如何？",
      "output_sha256": "a2a8e658aad959f9705a02885848fe60199f4ba38769b077453bf7354394a822",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "a2a8e658aad959f9705a02885848fe60199f4ba38769b077453bf7354394a822",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我脱口而出地回答：给我印象最深的是人人处处喜气洋洋！",
      "output_sha256": "82f0b34474c671b0134508ce5e7fff6398d323063901c1be5ecd77222dc51a9d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "82f0b34474c671b0134508ce5e7fff6398d323063901c1be5ecd77222dc51a9d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "难道我没看见莫斯科又添盖了多少座朴素而美观的大楼吗？",
      "output_sha256": "94a13b015bee29b59dca2a4538f8348c362c834189c19273f55bbc042a46ec94",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "94a13b015bee29b59dca2a4538f8348c362c834189c19273f55bbc042a46ec94",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "没看到百货店里的新货品吗？",
      "output_sha256": "a945d629e092ad095285352260b0f59706e587bd3cf8c976196766f0d4f60601",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.635,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
