      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这次的作家代表大会就是在这么个伟大时代召开的。",
      "output_sha256": "7298c8524a111d54311b335e4b2853d56aaf452acd6e187fe6d6e557680ac42f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "7298c8524a111d54311b335e4b2853d56aaf452acd6e187fe6d6e557680ac42f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这么一说，我们就容易看清楚这次大会的历史意义。",
      "output_sha256": "772cb3b0a0a0724a32b9c8c5ebc3f712841fa57e89152602806349436d111988",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "772cb3b0a0a0724a32b9c8c5ebc3f712841fa57e89152602806349436d111988",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "即使未能亲临其境，也颇可以想像到参加大会的苏联作家代表们该是多么兴奋，多么骄傲，多么光荣！",
      "output_sha256": "1fdba2728a53d0fbae31267d8747978839266b552dee77cfcbf0787feef9318d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "1fdba2728a53d0fbae31267d8747978839266b552dee77cfcbf0787feef9318d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "事实正是如此，他们欢聚一堂，互相激励，探讨如何描绘伟大时代的面貌和建设共产主义的英雄人物。",
      "output_sha256": "2db8c8b9913761e3b6d0f7250328d0abe23aa57875669c3f853009d38e472c8a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.673951,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24,
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b5cd1f5944996336c460575da70eca60dabf67582a2bb9065ea3fb4502a0176a",
        "551683aab01c2314c2544cf27c6470ed24eba4ffc5e0af88cde23be0ecafa566"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2db8c8b9913761e3b6d0f7250328d0abe23aa57875669c3f853009d38e472c8a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这是何等光荣而崇高的使命啊！",
      "output_sha256": "8ae37c3d45348019f9a1b7d73b41fb971ee76f71f7ace6bd6df3c062895a49eb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.58564,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "693e601fe17380d30cf0b916bc1dcd66476cc0ac88750d2eb046723957711bf5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8ae37c3d45348019f9a1b7d73b41fb971ee76f71f7ace6bd6df3c062895a49eb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "听了大会上的报告与发言，我的心要跳出来。",
      "output_sha256": "606cfca698c86effed17e24176d37ae99307ef338ce04284ce611e433772febd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "606cfca698c86effed17e24176d37ae99307ef338ce04284ce611e433772febd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我想：努力呀，中国的作家！",
      "output_sha256": "5c4c07d3a137a43e887afaeb9c5790f1321201f9aaa5cbc833afbb26c1b835d6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "5c4c07d3a137a43e887afaeb9c5790f1321201f9aaa5cbc833afbb26c1b835d6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "是的，只要我们不断努力，苏联作家的光荣使命也会落到我们肩上。",
      "output_sha256": "6df5e1396e7de0f6dd8c0a131eb11565a3a7f4ac019bcbc92cb9e0c944e7e6ba",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.644271,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6080b66ac335f9109b68818b001bd899a9c5cade7e3a64cb11656dcf01625798"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6df5e1396e7de0f6dd8c0a131eb11565a3a7f4ac019bcbc92cb9e0c944e7e6ba",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们一向以苏联作家为良师益友，由今天的形势看起来，我们就更应当多向良师益友学习，叫我们的文学事业绝对没有静止现象。",
      "output_sha256": "29229a3517343137873732afc7d39aa7e6725f307c51bf8f12d9685f4eb0aa01",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "29229a3517343137873732afc7d39aa7e6725f307c51bf8f12d9685f4eb0aa01",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们要作激流，不舍昼夜地跳跃前进。",
      "output_sha256": "cf0612f8eb611f68b2d7be5620c9bda4d010c68b92e5e598c4b94aa5e36560dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
