      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "的确，苏联作家笔下所描绘的今天，将让全人类看到应有的明天。",
      "output_sha256": "3345dd54dfe3fd37ddd77827b4605a2139bc986f87e96f03b7bc78688d7ca94f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.755506,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7346e295ef6abf06f2ae1d599b4d2adaf33c0dabdfc7b5ad78a8e022adb6af60"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3345dd54dfe3fd37ddd77827b4605a2139bc986f87e96f03b7bc78688d7ca94f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "社会主义现实主义文学的确有振奋全世界人心的力量。",
      "output_sha256": "c83f46c43ae1df373d470b6e51d5f5cfc61b5760dcd2c1ef2d2a44790ca419eb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "c83f46c43ae1df373d470b6e51d5f5cfc61b5760dcd2c1ef2d2a44790ca419eb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们也是社会主义现实主义文学的创作者，就叫我们的抱负远大些吧！",
      "output_sha256": "972f3dd573d1abb754b2bcea464c8c789fc643e72982d686d3955f3282522056",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "972f3dd573d1abb754b2bcea464c8c789fc643e72982d686d3955f3282522056",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一进入会场，不由地就想起两个最宝贵的字来——团结！",
      "output_sha256": "59f14d218d1454407a8ae1733571b61b818a16442a9cfd9ae323a9a1c03d9949",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "59f14d218d1454407a8ae1733571b61b818a16442a9cfd9ae323a9a1c03d9949",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "别以为我要说苏联作家团结的很好，这个说法还不够全面。",
      "output_sha256": "d1a1814dce8d2a2fe50ce3b6018bec4f7e065a427dcda27148c6729c9b5813c9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "d1a1814dce8d2a2fe50ce3b6018bec4f7e065a427dcda27148c6729c9b5813c9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我是要说：苏联各民族的文学都已成熟了。",
      "output_sha256": "c87ecf307a502c7a8f87f00d304b55705a8ca51ed6e33c8b1fc43e105c840c68",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "c87ecf307a502c7a8f87f00d304b55705a8ca51ed6e33c8b1fc43e105c840c68",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这真是一件大事，值得我们热烈祝贺！",
      "output_sha256": "6aaeddecbb8e2fd24648de02fbd77bd25b437eae8b40ab86398fbbb50400d34f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.675173,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "17262e48a6e63424671b8831b05c463df5bee214621bc364d3d6e77a20e1afeb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6aaeddecbb8e2fd24648de02fbd77bd25b437eae8b40ab86398fbbb50400d34f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "看，不仅是不同流派的作家，连各民族的作家也像兄弟般团结一致，共同为建设共产主义而努力。",
      "output_sha256": "b0a6ec2d2746fb1cce80bb0191a2237667273d3408bdf52fce4314e55204fac8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.591954,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3a02f02b9b8a3b7550eb2c07dd510907468f49d095d8dae189f4df5ba0616236"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b0a6ec2d2746fb1cce80bb0191a2237667273d3408bdf52fce4314e55204fac8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这是战无不胜的力量！",
      "output_sha256": "a0617b782ab583d9a789236ed05cd473c9a39fd05ec57fc115fd0c83149f66cf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "a0617b782ab583d9a789236ed05cd473c9a39fd05ec57fc115fd0c83149f66cf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "乱点就乱点吧，还得横插一笔：我们这次在大剧院看了两出歌剧和三出芭蕾舞，都是由阿塞拜疆的艺术家到莫斯科演出的。",
      "output_sha256": "ef4846e76ddd06c889430ebff005bc1a05fff54d7e6a293d3dd1425f1731dc37",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "ef4846e76ddd06c889430ebff005bc1a05fff54d7e6a293d3dd1425f1731dc37",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "专家们称赞这些节目极为出色，尤其是《七美图》的舞剧音乐，已达到了世界水平。",
      "output_sha256": "3977feee964c0f86f2bd4ab7653db7fcd77a2f1f0f28d0a81bb349f3e8642c85",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.577799,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        42,
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ca0b4460dfe4fd63f5c5fc7e78e8c66f6c9252e8ac42b21fdacb1c5cf726e25f",
        "519d76eeefb1f29f54f9168a403b86106ce3ad4cd41c8e98ee7f7ba7c300a6f0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3977feee964c0f86f2bd4ab7653db7fcd77a2f1f0f28d0a81bb349f3e8642c85",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这证实了各民族的文艺创作确已获得很高的成就。",
      "output_sha256": "ba06c95af58123682c2d32255562aa80d78e0c22634020d91bcf9c07234ba866",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "ba06c95af58123682c2d32255562aa80d78e0c22634020d91bcf9c07234ba866",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "单就文学作品来说，各民族互相译书已成为一件极为重要的工作。",
      "output_sha256": "da5b2b891c18222a9791bef58df2f799fa0eab171ac4b4a91d03c25859afd8cb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "da5b2b891c18222a9791bef58df2f799fa0eab171ac4b4a91d03c25859afd8cb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "各兄弟国家都有代表团出席大会，还有许多西方国家的进步作家也来祝贺。",
      "output_sha256": "3315f261fa40e4ddf3339488ed2e19cbf2a348a46cb9d086b118955b15864761",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "3315f261fa40e4ddf3339488ed2e19cbf2a348a46cb9d086b118955b15864761",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "于此，团结的意义可就更大了。",
      "output_sha256": "a8b647d3168dc52527b248e4fc3209294f445aa60bc5bfbefc0dfe2cab5f1678",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "a8b647d3168dc52527b248e4fc3209294f445aa60bc5bfbefc0dfe2cab5f1678",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "毫无疑问，社会主义现实主义的文学已是世界范围的了。",
      "output_sha256": "882984ba601b54910d4e078212cdc889ad42a671ef72250251178c615d7d8e71",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "882984ba601b54910d4e078212cdc889ad42a671ef72250251178c615d7d8e71",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这个力量足以打退任何修正主义与一切邪魔外道。",
      "output_sha256": "4bd3f6737a9187f5b9fad26abfb956ebd84991d2914479981b7312003514fd5c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "4bd3f6737a9187f5b9fad26abfb956ebd84991d2914479981b7312003514fd5c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不管修正主义者怎样恶毒地攻击我们，也无碍社会主义现实主义的文学如旭日东升，普照全世。",
      "output_sha256": "3bf78d1479fde0d95252530a6affa2092bb7b17dad7bc834787eccee0adea42e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "3bf78d1479fde0d95252530a6affa2092bb7b17dad7bc834787eccee0adea42e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "另一个值得关注的问题是青年作家的培养。",
      "output_sha256": "1ad8cb43b1b4891f2bd6dfc4edff0ec315b0161a8f465717940901b1ab931709",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.610212,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8341c39f24ba9d8cf67787e4da1e264d329326295909650bf2d32f6e4078617f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1ad8cb43b1b4891f2bd6dfc4edff0ec315b0161a8f465717940901b1ab931709",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "苏共中央对大会的祝词，赫鲁晓夫同志在大会上的讲话，和苏尔科夫同志在大会上作的报告，都着重地提到这个重要问题。",
      "output_sha256": "7f91f9bd6c9480c450d699abfe2688a82ed8df14b60437eefd47bef0c69d30da",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "7f91f9bd6c9480c450d699abfe2688a82ed8df14b60437eefd47bef0c69d30da",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "怎样培养呢？",
      "output_sha256": "f0865681d636609b28913fadb32cc3221d167569617a5d7de17414730767f332",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "f0865681d636609b28913fadb32cc3221d167569617a5d7de17414730767f332",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "请看赫鲁晓夫同志的讲话——已在我们的报纸上发表。",
      "output_sha256": "ba56bcf458902808be9d09a8579ec5e52ca069b0f0104809f44159285b7f8d76",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.810714,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6d3fd0e6351a4aeda816c609541b9e4ef56584236d74dfb4b49b8a059483099c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ba56bcf458902808be9d09a8579ec5e52ca069b0f0104809f44159285b7f8d76",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "对此问题，我们应认真学习这些文件，吸取经验。",
      "output_sha256": "982b51ba5e0f98cec5dc44a149458a879ec448abe1589a594606905fb0b4a7ba",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": 0.625439,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2a11b9068107774f995fb63dc0e5628138446147097c1974c47e5f16a6faa4df"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_ai_sha256": "982b51ba5e0f98cec5dc44a149458a879ec448abe1589a594606905fb0b4a7ba",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在高尔基文学讲习所的座谈会上，我也听到一些宝贵的意见，介绍在这里：讲习所不单给青年们以文学知识，而且在道德品质上教育他们如何作个作家；这样，即使他们不能成为一个卓越的作家，至少也能作个忠诚可靠的文艺工作者。",
      "output_sha256": "7afff9c91442429f9c74b38f5bf196e04eeb663edfc5ff565a4bce624a3e6930",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "7afff9c91442429f9c74b38f5bf196e04eeb663edfc5ff565a4bce624a3e6930",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "讲习所的学员来自各个民族，招生时必定要求他们拥有一定的生活与劳动经验，以及文学才能。",
      "output_sha256": "2f683a76de80f8eed76361f5a5ced83da098cc843a89392131006988d0d8056c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": 0.595044,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        57,
        58
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "93962f30164883076369fa850c5bf26833e0700e625f232d43d11249c52c6eb9",
        "34c8afbcddfdad6279f7d717553b302a1d877e6591f2d69798eae57073568576"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2f683a76de80f8eed76361f5a5ced83da098cc843a89392131006988d0d8056c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我觉得这些方法非常好，简单粗暴的做法实在不妥。",
      "output_sha256": "ecb1f2aefdcaee105bee653368beca74204d5159337aed258e6c7e2d9636b027",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": 0.395735,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
